🎯 Standard Selection Guide (Scenario-Based)
Quick matching of acceptance standards based on project attributes:
- Consumer Electronics → IPC Class 1
- Industrial Control / Communication Equipment → IPC Class 2
- Medical Equipment / Key Automotive Electronics → IPC Class 3
- Military / Aerospace Equipment → GJB 362B Grade Ⅲ
- Ordinary Domestic Civilian Projects → GB/T 4588 Series (2025 New Version)
- Space-Grade Avionics → GJB Grade Ⅲ + Supplementary Verification (Equivalent to IPC 3A)

---
✅ Standard PCB Acceptance Workflow
Unified executable inspection process for hardware and quality engineers:
1. Determine product reliability grade and match corresponding acceptance standard
2. Align Gerber files, drilling files and process parameters with selected standard specifications
3. PCB visual appearance workmanship inspection
4. Key dimension verification: line width, line spacing, annular ring, board thickness, registration accuracy
5. 100% continuity test and dielectric withstand voltage test
6. Complete environmental and reliability tests according to standard grade requirements
7. Issue official acceptance report, mark the exact standard number and version

